        "start": "2026-10-12T00:00:00Z",
        "title": "sbom-tools validation assessment — NTIA Minimum Elements",
        "uuid": "4b9aa242-ee06-5031-bba2-82c36515b94d"
      },
      {
        "description": "Validation results for CISA 2026 Minimum Elements, derived only from the supplied SBOM.",
        "findings": [
          {
            "description": "Overall verdict for CISA 2026 Minimum Elements: 9 error(s), 3 warning(s), 0 informational finding(s).",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "cisa-2026-compliance",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "CISA 2026 Minimum Elements compliance roll-up",
            "uuid": "3e890aa5-30a6-53f7-ac87-bf741de8281b"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] SBOM Author missing: no Person or Organization creator names the entity that created the SBOM data (tool-only creator lists do not satisfy the element — the author is the entity operating the tool, not the tool itself)",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:c121631bf022b328"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-AUTHOR|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "25bc1d06-add4-5de8-85b6-b9ebf7c31919"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Add a Person or Organization creator naming the entity that created the SBOM data — the entity operating the generation tool, not the tool itself, so tool-only creator lists do not satisfy the element. Use full names, no acronyms. CycloneDX: add metadata.authors\\[\\] (name, email) or metadata.manufacturer (name, contact\\[\\].email); metadata.tools entries do not count.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-author",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-AUTHOR",
            "uuid": "1db86a7f-9d04-58f9-9756-bfd35056672c"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] No SBOM Author Signature found in the document (CycloneDX JSF signature or SPDX 3 verifiedUsing signature); SPDX 2.x cannot express one in-document and detached signatures are invisible to this check",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:a8f36f3ede2cbd0f"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-SIGNATURE|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "9498e049-e528-536c-984d-a0e63f1399e3"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Sign the SBOM with a digital signature attributable to the SBOM author, using an algorithm approved per NIST DSS, ISO/IEC 14888-4:2024, or the ENISA Agreed Cryptographic Mechanisms. Detached signatures are invisible to this check, and not every format can carry one in-document — hence Warning, not Error. SPDX 2.x has no in-document signature field, so the rule is not evaluated for SPDX 2.x documents. CycloneDX: sign the BOM: in JSON, a JSF signature object (algorithm and value) at the document root; in XML, an enveloped XML-DSig \\<Signature\\> element on \\<bom\\>.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-signature",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-SIGNATURE",
            "uuid": "f0117fdd-656c-5dae-ba07-e510f8886a58"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] SBOM Generation Context missing: no software lifecycle phase is declared (CycloneDX 1.5+ metadata.lifecycles, e.g. 'pre-build', 'build', 'post-build'; SPDX 2.x has no standard field)",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:98b748f2ca790daf"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-GENERATION-CONTEXT|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "43526641-849d-5ee7-924c-227339f1de3f"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Declare the lifecycle phase the SBOM was generated in — 'before build', 'build', 'after build', or a more specific identifier. Warning, not Error: not every format can carry the phase. SPDX 2.x has no standard field for it, so the rule is not evaluated for SPDX 2.x documents. CycloneDX: set metadata.lifecycles\\[\\].phase, e.g. build (the first entry is read).",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-generation-context",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-GENERATION-CONTEXT",
            "uuid": "8f218173-dcc5-58a5-8425-64fb95e158ae"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] Component 'test-app' names no producer (author/originator, manufacturer or supplier) and is not explicitly marked as of unknown provenance",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:237e61efe1f7dfd4"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-PRODUCER|test-app"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "0d1869a6-7be3-5454-92a6-6f0e2abe44b2"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Identify each component's producer (the 2026 rename of the ambiguous Supplier Name): the entity that created the component is preferred, its supplier or manufacturer is accepted; if no clear producer exists, explicitly mark the component as of unknown provenance. File-type entries are exempt. CycloneDX: set components\\[\\].supplier.name (or manufacturer.name, or authors\\[\\].name).",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-producer",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-PRODUCER",
            "uuid": "bd1214b4-7aa1-58a9-aac4-f5a51ea6073e"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] Component 'test-app' has no machine-processable identifier (CPE or PURL are named by the element; SWHID/SWID also qualify)",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:17ed5a828034d7b5"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-IDENTIFIER|test-app"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "cbe3e387-24f3-537d-9483-36bd8fb2d903"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Add at least one common machine-processable identifier per component — the document names CPE and PURL (ECMA-427); UUIDs, organization-specific identifiers, commit hashes, and intrinsic identifiers (OmniBOR, SWHID / ISO/IEC 18670:2025) also qualify. Include all known identifiers. CycloneDX: set components\\[\\].purl (or cpe, or swhid\\[\\]).",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-identifier",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-IDENTIFIER",
            "uuid": "e9092ff3-653e-5e86-8a26-125fb615f0d5"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] Component 'test-app' carries no cryptographic hash of the executable component artifact (explicitly indicate the value is unknown when the artifact is not available to the SBOM author)",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:9d8266cde530b4f9"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-HASH|test-app"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "2a1bbe98-41be-5cab-bc8e-20abbee76282"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Provide an ASCII-hexadecimal cryptographic hash of each executable component artifact; when the SBOM author lacks access to the artifact, explicitly indicate the value is unknown. CycloneDX: add components\\[\\].hashes\\[\\] entries with alg SHA-256, SHA-384 or SHA-512 and the content.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-hash",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-HASH",
            "uuid": "3423b263-55cc-5ad5-8de9-0d02e1d1bd0d"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] Component 'test-app' has no license information and no explicit unknown indication (prefer SPDX identifiers; use NOASSERTION when the license is unknown to the author)",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:9942ba05bb3e949d"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-LICENSE|test-app"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "ce65f8dc-8978-5a2a-97b2-5b13c5bb0465"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Declare each component's license(s), preferring machine-processable SPDX license identifiers; a LicenseRef-\\* expression or a pointer to where the full license details are available also satisfies the element, and an explicit unknown (NOASSERTION) is required when the author is unaware. Silent absence and a placeholder such as TBD fail. CycloneDX: add components\\[\\].licenses\\[\\] entries (license.id with an SPDX identifier, or an expression).",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-license",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-LICENSE",
            "uuid": "88dee765-20db-57eb-955f-d9a875a67d54"
          },
          {
